 (7, "\"We have thirty miles to go. And the sun is not done with us.\"", "\"We have most of a mile to go. And the sun is not done with us.\""),
 (7, "flat and commandant", "flat and commanding"),
 (7, "Mags, who had been sitting on a rock, looked up, her blue scarf bright against the pale dust. \"So we subtract?\"\n\n\"Subtract,\" Isla said. \"The expansion is small, but it is there. We have to account for it.\"", "Mags, who had been sitting on a rock, looked up, her blue scarf bright against the pale dust. \"So we add a little?\"\n\n\"Add,\" Isla said. \"A hot chain is longer than its marks say, so each pull covers more ground than we credit it. The expansion is small, but it is there. We have to account for it.\""),
 (8, "We would be here until the heat death of the universe.", "We would be here until the world wore out."),
 (8, "\"Forty-five, thirty, twelve,\" she said.", "\"Fifty-seven, thirty, twelve,\" she said."),
 (8, "Isla calculated it. The sum of the angles in a triangle is always one hundred and eighty degrees. She had measured two. The third was implied.", "The sum of the angles in a triangle is always one hundred and eighty degrees. She had measured two from the baseline; Joss and Mags carried the sightglass out to the red flag, and she read the third from there."),
 (8, "\"Forty-nine, twenty-nine, forty-eight,\" she said softly.", "\"Eighty, nineteen, forty-eight,\" she said softly."),
