 (13, "\"We are one hundred and twelve people,\" she said. \"We have been cut off from the kingdom. We have no tax, no post, no road. We are living in a gap in the map.\"", "\"You are one hundred and twelve people,\" she said. \"You have been cut off from the kingdom. No tax, no post, no road. You are living in a gap in the map.\""),
 (15, "\"My grandmother said the same thing,\" he murmured", "\"Hester said the same thing,\" he murmured"),
 (15, "\"This is where my grandmother put her first station,\"", "\"This is where Hester put her first station,\""),
 (15, "But they agree with my grandmother’s work.", "But they agree with my great-grandmother’s work."),
 (15, "My grandmother knew it. She did not trust their center.", "Hester knew it. She did not trust their center."),
