 (16, "It is a feature, Miss Corrin, not a bug.", "It is a feature of the plan, Miss Corrin, not a flaw in it."),
 (18, "Wynne, the miller, walked beside them with the weary pride of a man", "The miller walked beside them with the weary pride of a man"),
